
>> city := Lista ← ['London'] ; ['Paris'] ; ['Berlin'].
>> temperature := Lista ← ['15'] ; ['16'] ; ['15'].
>> weather := temperature skont: city.
>> cities := weather iskrizzjonijiet issortja: { :a :b <- (a qabbel: b). }.
>> temperatures := weather valuri issortja: { :a :b <- (a qabbel: b) negattiv?. }.

Ħruġ ikteb: (cities għaqqad: [',']), linja-ġdida.
Ħruġ ikteb: (temperatures għaqqad: [',']), linja-ġdida.
